      "body": "## Motivation\n\nPreserve the FP32 routing weights returned by the NPU TopK path until `npu_moe_finalize_routing` so BF16 hidden states do not reduce routing precision. Fixes #39351.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Removed the hidden-state dtype conversion from `AscendTPDispatcher.dispatch`.\n- Added a registered unit test covering FP32 weight preservation and int32 expert IDs.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- `python3 test/registered/unit/layers/moe/test_ascend_tp_dispatcher.py -v` could not run locally because the environment does not provide `torch`.\n- Ascend NPU accuracy validation was not run because no Ascend NPU hardware is available in this environment.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot run. This change removes a dtype conversion and adds no new runtime operation.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to the [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n## Review and Merge Process\n\nPlease review the dispatcher behavior and run Ascend hardware validation before merging.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #34808690381](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/34808690381)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #34808690236](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions